request.description:
### Auth Admin Custom Token

This endpoint allows the admin to generate a custom token.

#### Request Body

- form-data
    - email (text)
    - token (text)

#### Response

The response for this request can be represented as a JSON schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "data": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "idToken": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "refreshToken": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "expiresIn": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "isNewUser": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
}

 ```

